WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:02.400
How to use Paste Guard, in about 90 seconds.

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.800
Install Paste Guard from the Chrome Web Store.

3
00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:09.800
Open the puzzle menu and pin it, so its settings are one click away.

4
00:00:11.800 --> 00:00:14.800
Paste something sensitive into a supported AI chat. Here is made-up text.

5
00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:18.000
Paste Guard pauses the paste and lists what it found, before anything is sent.

6
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:21.800
Only the first two characters of each value are shown. Nothing leaves your device.

7
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:27.000
Choose Paste masked, or press Enter. Each value becomes a numbered placeholder.

8
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Paste anyway and Cancel are there too. You always have the final say.

9
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:31.800
Now send the message.

10
00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:38.000
The assistant only ever receives the placeholders, such as EMAIL_1.

11
00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:42.000
When its reply uses a placeholder, your screen shows your own value again.

12
00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:45.800
Press Option+R to see what the assistant really saw, and again to switch back.

13
00:00:47.800 --> 00:00:51.000
Mask a word of your own: select it in the message box.

14
00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:54.500
Press Option+Shift+M, or the Mask this button. It becomes a placeholder.

15
00:00:54.500 --> 00:00:57.800
The word is saved to a personal dictionary on your device, for every future paste.

16
00:00:59.800 --> 00:01:03.000
Open the Paste Guard icon to change settings, such as turning a detector off.

17
00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:06.500
With Email off, the same text no longer flags the email.

18
00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:12.000
Press Ignore on a row to let that exact value through. Only a one-way hash is kept.

19
00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:15.800
Then paste masked as before.

20
00:01:17.800 --> 00:01:21.500
Check it yourself: chrome://extensions shows only the storage permission and the supported sites.

21
00:01:21.500 --> 00:01:25.000
Keep the Network tab open while you paste: nothing is sent.

22
00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:29.500
Paste Guard is a safety net, not a guarantee. Try the interactive tour on the Paste Guard website.
